  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"DsSlI\" id=\"DsSlI\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucee4d9a6\" id=\"ucee4d9a6\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">什么是控制系统</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u1076d4a5\" id=\"u1076d4a5\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc7b83ed1\" id=\"uc7b83ed1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">人其实也是一个复杂的控制系统，体温，血压，ph值等...</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf4ad39f5\" id=\"uf4ad39f5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5a46f25e\" id=\"u5a46f25e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">人： 走进很热的房间，体温升高， sensor皮肤表面，感觉到热，controller下丘脑释放神经胆碱，你开始出汗。水分蒸发带走热量，体温回到正常。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u164bb7f5\" id=\"u164bb7f5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u731bd3c6\" id=\"u731bd3c6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">电梯：当用户选择楼层后，电梯会在指定楼层停靠。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0f2e7e97\" id=\"u0f2e7e97\"><span data-lake-id=\"u36c915fc\" id=\"u36c915fc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">汽车，地铁，自动门，飞机定速巡航，自动导航都需要用到控制系统。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"Js1vb\" id=\"Js1vb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u35dd236d\" id=\"u35dd236d\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">开环控制(Open Loop Control)</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u5d721a60\" id=\"u5d721a60\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fjpeg%2F27903758%2F1689638770914-8ba5347a-c653-48e1-8553-df695b8dc90f.jpeg%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u9a4cc8f9-61cc-40f7-aced-8a57839a6ea%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9872db80-7c25-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A226.6666717529297%2C%22height%22%3A173%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22pid5.jpg%22%2C%22size%22%3A10913%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A393%2C%22originHeight%22%3A300%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%BB%91%E9%A9%AC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%91%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A306%2C%22y%22%3A274%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23ededed%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uf6839563%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u55200ad6\" id=\"u55200ad6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u352de57b\" id=\"u352de57b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">根据你选定的时间，衣服类型进行控制， 清洗不是根据衣服的干净程度控制。 一旦洗衣机开始运行，时间到了就停止工作，不管衣服是不是清洗干净了。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf1cd2e63\" id=\"uf1cd2e63\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1689638787538-56a2f6e7-8588-4214-9c27-d00c9a47f717.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u27f18e84-1eec-49c4-b981-618bdf0dedc%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9872db80-7c25-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A354.6666564941406%2C%22height%22%3A49%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22pid6.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A14369%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A753%2C%22originHeight%22%3A104%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%83%A8%E4%BB%B6%22%2C%22x%22%3A344%2C%22y%22%3A39%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A632%2C%22y%22%3A39%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%22%2C%22x%22%3A42%2C%22y%22%3A39%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%233a3e44%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ufe19fe64%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"J1dPj\" id=\"J1dPj\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2f43656a\" id=\"u2f43656a\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">闭环控制</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"ud0564084\" id=\"ud0564084\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1689638810623-ef939846-0fb8-42e6-8691-09de4e038aa0.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u81371320-27ad-41fc-be84-ad1a8fd9056%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9872db80-7c25-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A342.3333435058594%2C%22height%22%3A121%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22pid7.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A23960%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A750%2C%22originHeight%22%3A264%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%83%A8%E4%BB%B6%22%2C%22x%22%3A358%2C%22y%22%3A49%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%22%2C%22x%22%3A40%2C%22y%22%3A49%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A629%2C%22y%22%3A49%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%BB%91%E9%A9%AC%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%8F%E5%91%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A673%2C%22y%22%3A237%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BC%A0%E6%84%9F%E5%99%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A371%2C%22y%22%3A199%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23000000%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ud3a9d1fd%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0060e50e\" id=\"u0060e50e\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fjpeg%2F27903758%2F1689638823580-3528c4fe-b2bf-4802-99b5-6cef44dfeb31.jpeg%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u17782751-5b7d-4b80-a57e-541fbca6dd2%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9872db80-7c25-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A329.4444580078125%2C%22height%22%3A131%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22pid8.jpg%22%2C%22size%22%3A17180%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A703%2C%22originHeight%22%3A279%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%BE%8ENLIDEA%22%2C%22x%22%3A320%2C%22y%22%3A82%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%A9%AC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%91%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A634%2C%22y%22%3A252%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23adb1b7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22udf01502f%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u55d7f36e\" id=\"u55d7f36e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u753a147d\" id=\"u753a147d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">变频空调就采用了闭环控制。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ueb26ef01\" id=\"ueb26ef01\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1689638840868-675c2a1e-343c-44d6-b409-0eabd0d39122.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u2772829e-32a9-44f7-a517-24995058a8b%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9872db80-7c25-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A402.22222900390625%2C%22height%22%3A123%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22pid9.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A33589%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A860%2C%22originHeight%22%3A264%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%A1%AC%E4%BB%B6%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E5%8A%9F%E7%8E%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A721%2C%22y%22%3A50%2C%22width%22%3A110%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%B8%A9%E5%BA%A6%E6%84%9F%E5%BA%94%E5%99%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A410%2C%22y%22%3A200%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E9%81%A5%E6%8E%A7%E5%99%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A38%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%98%E9%A2%91%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95%22%2C%22x%22%3A320%2C%22y%22%3A50%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%9D%BF%22%2C%22x%22%3A529%2C%22y%22%3A50%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%BB%91%E9%A9%AC%E6%91%84%E5%BA%8F%E5%91%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A783%2C%22y%22%3A238%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%22%2C%22x%22%3A49%2C%22y%22%3A39%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23000000%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uf587c8c3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"EZPnw\" id=\"EZPnw\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4551a243\" id=\"u4551a243\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">位式控制算法</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u3001ec66\" id=\"u3001ec66\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc1f58ec9\" id=\"uc1f58ec9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">早期的空调采用的算法是位式控制算法。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uafc303b4\" id=\"uafc303b4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubd264e54\" id=\"ubd264e54\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">位式控制的算法，输出信号只有两种，True和False</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue41e26fa\" id=\"ue41e26fa\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc92c62aa\" id=\"uc92c62aa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">依据比较（sv和pv）</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1dcff776\" id=\"u1dcff776\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8bbb17ab\" id=\"u8bbb17ab\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">缺点：pv总是在sv的值上下波动</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub5595d27\" id=\"ub5595d27\"><span data-lake-id=\"u551b1a1a\" id=\"u551b1a1a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">原因：控制对象具有惯性，空调降温时是慢慢往下降的，某个时刻自动断电，如果温度超出设定值，又自动的供电进行制冷。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9b4973ae\" id=\"u9b4973ae\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3408db7a\" id=\"u3408db7a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">​</span><br></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"JhgIR\" id=\"JhgIR\"><span data-lake-id=\"uee7318be\" id=\"uee7318be\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">PID算法</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u990fa115\" id=\"u990fa115\"><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/347372624?utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=1228102558839222272\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u0ba53b09\" id=\"u0ba53b09\"><span data-lake-id=\"u69efa7e3\" id=\"u69efa7e3\">https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/347372624?utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=1228102558839222272</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"ueb3caf27\" id=\"ueb3caf27\"><span data-lake-id=\"u735c5d19\" id=\"u735c5d19\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">空调的变频算法其实就是PID算法。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u899d9034\" id=\"u899d9034\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1689638906916-f8c51b8b-db93-4c8d-80f9-a8f3a726c961.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u8eb0f148-6915-489c-9e37-baa2fa67408%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9872db80-7c25-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A433.3333435058594%2C%22height%22%3A170%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22pid10.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A57859%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A939%2C%22originHeight%22%3A369%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%BB%91%E9%A9%AC%E7%A6%8F%E5%BA%8F%E5%91%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A837%2C%22y%22%3A338%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%B8%A9%E5%BA%A6%E6%84%9F%E5%BA%94%E5%99%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A516%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DERIVATIVE%22%2C%22x%22%3A349%2C%22y%22%3A206%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E9%81%A5%E6%8E%A7%E5%99%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A33%2C%22y%22%3A145%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%98%E9%A2%91%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95%22%2C%22x%22%3A355%2C%22y%22%3A28%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROPORTIONAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A340%2C%22y%22%3A76%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%A1%AC%E4%BB%B6%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E5%8A%9F%E7%8E%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A801%2C%22y%22%3A135%2C%22width%22%3A109%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NTEGRAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A362%2C%22y%22%3A141%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%9D%BF%22%2C%22x%22%3A588%2C%22y%22%3A134%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%22%2C%22x%22%3A41%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BE%AE%E5%88%86%22%2C%22x%22%3A358%2C%22y%22%3A226%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%AF%94%E4%BE%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A350%2C%22y%22%3A96%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%A7%AF%E5%88%86%22%2C%22x%22%3A369%2C%22y%22%3A162%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23000000%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u99c6c728%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf40293c9\" id=\"uf40293c9\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc506113a\" id=\"uc506113a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">proportional（比例）， integral（积分），derivative（微分）</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ued7c9358\" id=\"ued7c9358\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue490f98e\" id=\"ue490f98e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">对位式控制的优化</span></p><ol list=\"ud1dec788\"><li fid=\"uae1fbd41\" data-lake-id=\"u66b77ea4\" id=\"u66b77ea4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5e93026d\" id=\"u5e93026d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">位式控制，只考虑当前。</span></li><li fid=\"uae1fbd41\" data-lake-id=\"u2c5ca7d7\" id=\"u2c5ca7d7\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc38251cd\" id=\"uc38251cd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">pid不仅考虑当前，还要考虑历史</span></li><li fid=\"uae1fbd41\" data-lake-id=\"u271f7598\" id=\"u271f7598\"><span data-lake-id=\"u24e1cd0a\" id=\"u24e1cd0a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">pid输出更多样，更平滑。不是是true或者false，</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u158c60c2\" id=\"u158c60c2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2745588\" id=\"ub2745588\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">变频空调的P控制：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud9dcfea4\" id=\"ud9dcfea4\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1689638923830-9dca9e3f-4ded-4791-bc92-0c2771348c3b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ude38dba7-163d-4c2d-965d-ad75f2a79c7%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9872db80-7c25-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A375.5555725097656%2C%22height%22%3A123%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22pid11.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A16136%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A701%2C%22originHeight%22%3A229%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROPORTIONAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A232%2C%22y%22%3A74%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%BE%8E%E9%A9%AC%E5%87%9D%E5%BA%8F%E8%B4%9D%22%2C%22x%22%3A635%2C%22y%22%3A206%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%AF%94%E4%BE%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A254%2C%22y%22%3A94%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23000000%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u0fa237a2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><blockquote data-lake-id=\"ue738779b\" id=\"ue738779b\" class=\"lake-alert lake-alert-info\"><p data-lake-id=\"u38f07ea8\" id=\"u38f07ea8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u473c8d30\" id=\"u473c8d30\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">error是误差。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue3845aa1\" id=\"ue3845aa1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u264abcc4\" id=\"u264abcc4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">k是一个系数。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7f91e897\" id=\"u7f91e897\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc73515e0\" id=\"uc73515e0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">设置值的温度和当前温度存在误差，我们可以设置这个空调的温度为 当前温度减去 误差值(或者给个系数)，长久来说，当前温度会在设定温度上下浮动。</span></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id=\"u4dc6f597\" id=\"u4dc6f597\"><span data-lake-id=\"u901467c5\" id=\"u901467c5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">变频空调的I控制：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u68480af0\" id=\"u68480af0\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1689638953457-b9b5c23a-a6fb-4580-a629-eb790f1712f2.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u2fae0c8c-cc68-4247-adb2-b6fb3614ff4%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9872db80-7c25-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A408.22222900390625%2C%22height%22%3A166%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22pid12.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A38766%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A806%2C%22originHeight%22%3A327%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOTALERROR%3DERRO%22%2C%22x%22%3A236%2C%22y%22%3A195%2C%22width%22%3A172%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%BB%91%E9%A9%AC%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%9C%E5%91%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A712%2C%22y%22%3A295%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ERROR%3DPV-SV%22%2C%22x%22%3A240%2C%22y%22%3A75%2C%22width%22%3A136%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROPORTIONAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A261%2C%22y%22%3A114%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%22%2C%22x%22%3A284%2C%22y%22%3A28%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%AF%94%E4%BE%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A287%2C%22y%22%3A134%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INTEGRAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A282%2C%22y%22%3A239%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%A7%AF%E5%88%86%22%2C%22x%22%3A290%2C%22y%22%3A258%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23000000%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uafd48509%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><blockquote data-lake-id=\"ue474fa67\" id=\"ue474fa67\" class=\"lake-alert lake-alert-info\"><p data-lake-id=\"u5d1656a1\" id=\"u5d1656a1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u57d7303c\" id=\"u57d7303c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">I算法主要是记录历史的错误，将这些错误进行累加。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1756fcc5\" id=\"u1756fcc5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua0b095f3\" id=\"ua0b095f3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">在P控制中，当前温度是在设定温度上下摆动的，因此，误差应该是有正有负，全部累加到一起，正负抵消，剩下的得到的是总误差值。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u107e53c2\" id=\"u107e53c2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud96de8a2\" id=\"ud96de8a2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">让当前温度+总误差（或者给定系数），让当前温度趋向于设定温度。</span></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id=\"u9b3a176e\" id=\"u9b3a176e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9f71de46\" id=\"u9f71de46\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">变频空调的D控制</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u99ef5ad8\" id=\"u99ef5ad8\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1689639030194-647aee7c-6b61-4b87-b823-80c7a4229e45.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ufa09eeb6-179e-4e24-8565-5bc4104de2d%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9872db80-7c25-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A514.1111145019531%2C%22height%22%3A235%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22pid13.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A57902%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1060%2C%22originHeight%22%3A484%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22DELTAERROR%3DCURI%22%2C%22x%22%3A240%2C%22y%22%3A345%2C%22width%22%3A167%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOTALERROR%3DERRO%22%2C%22x%22%3A241%2C%22y%22%3A197%2C%22width%22%3A172%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%80%9D%E9%A9%AC%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%87%E5%91%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A928%2C%22y%22%3A445%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROPORTIONAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A265%2C%22y%22%3A114%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ERROR%3DPV-SV%22%2C%22x%22%3A250%2C%22y%22%3A76%2C%22width%22%3A128%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%22%2C%22x%22%3A290%2C%22y%22%3A28%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%AF%94%E4%BE%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A279%2C%22y%22%3A134%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NTEGRA%22%2C%22x%22%3A292%2C%22y%22%3A240%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DERIVATIY%22%2C%22x%22%3A280%2C%22y%22%3A390%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%A7%AF%E5%88%86%22%2C%22x%22%3A297%2C%22y%22%3A261%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BE%AE%E5%88%86%22%2C%22x%22%3A289%2C%22y%22%3A412%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23000000%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2d69f255%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u8a84c4d4\" id=\"u8a84c4d4\" class=\"lake-alert lake-alert-info\"><p data-lake-id=\"u362253cf\" id=\"u362253cf\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc39798f5\" id=\"uc39798f5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">D算法主要是记录当前误差和最近一次的误差，</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7cd30b95\" id=\"u7cd30b95\"><span data-lake-id=\"u58c13549\" id=\"u58c13549\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">两次误差比较结果为0，说明已经到达设置水平。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1ec2b01a\" id=\"u1ec2b01a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7dec0a86\" id=\"u7dec0a86\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">两次误差比较结果绝对值大，说明往反方向走，温度没有趋向于设置的值，反而还在背离。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9cd116a3\" id=\"u9cd116a3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6e382d0c\" id=\"u6e382d0c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">让当前温度+两次误差比较结果（给定系数），可以收敛误差，让温度值更趋向于设定温度。</span></p></blockquote><h2 data-lake-id=\"yofQj\" id=\"yofQj\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua334fe31\" id=\"ua334fe31\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">位置式PID</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u87987d3e\" id=\"u87987d3e\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1689639192122-8d6df2b1-3969-407b-a051-292c816d04cf.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22udd057f65-c170-46b0-a2da-7b971aa97c3%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9872db80-7c25-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A339.22222900390625%2C%22height%22%3A57%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%2211.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A2216%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A455%2C%22originHeight%22%3A76%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22E(I%2BKN%5BE(K)%E4%B8%80EK-1)%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A209%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A238%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3DKE(K)%2BK%22%2C%22x%22%3A36%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A178%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22I%3D0%22%2C%22x%22%3A188%2C%22y%22%3A52%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23faf8f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u555bce3e%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u96b7aa26\" id=\"u96b7aa26\" class=\"lake-alert lake-alert-info\"><p data-lake-id=\"u9f633744\" id=\"u9f633744\"><span data-lake-id=\"u71aeca62\" id=\"u71aeca62\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">e(k):</span><span data-lake-id=\"u75282c96\" id=\"u75282c96\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0101100d\" id=\"u0101100d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">用户设定的值（目标值） - 控制对象的当前的状态值</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9da10d42\" id=\"u9da10d42\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3d62f205\" id=\"u3d62f205\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">比例P :</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u895a020f\" id=\"u895a020f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u9367ef58\" id=\"u9367ef58\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">e(k)</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub480b261\" id=\"ub480b261\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc465fefe\" id=\"uc465fefe\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">积分I :</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8a888087\" id=\"u8a888087\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ufd66c126\" id=\"ufd66c126\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">∑e(i) 误差的累加</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc8f0c7fd\" id=\"uc8f0c7fd\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u301cf6e2\" id=\"u301cf6e2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">微分D :</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufebddae2\" id=\"ufebddae2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> e(k) - e(k-1) 这次误差-上次误差</span></p></blockquote><h2 data-lake-id=\"UBeyJ\" id=\"UBeyJ\"><span data-lake-id=\"u76e1e053\" id=\"u76e1e053\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">增量式PID<br /></span><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1689639224330-a7147f85-97f2-4ad6-ad99-92d841ed1d17.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u56b3ffc0-2255-4f92-9cb5-b87e4e253e9%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9872db80-7c25-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A449.6666564941406%2C%22height%22%3A79%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%2212.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A14885%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A600%2C%22originHeight%22%3A106%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3DKP%5BE(K)-E(K-1)%5D%2BKE(K)%2BKO%5BE(K)-2E(K-1)%2BE(K-2)%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A57%2C%22y%22%3A60%2C%22width%22%3A526%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AUK%3D(K-U(K-1)%22%2C%22x%22%3A13%2C%22y%22%3A15%2C%22width%22%3A201%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fcfbfb%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u6e99be2f%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></h2><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u3158f42d\" id=\"u3158f42d\" class=\"lake-alert lake-alert-info\"><p data-lake-id=\"u7ca67ef6\" id=\"u7ca67ef6\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf7df2603\" id=\"uf7df2603\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">比例P :</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u275992ba\" id=\"u275992ba\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ub073c4ee\" id=\"ub073c4ee\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">e(k)-e(k-1) 这次误差-上次误差</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u80c01fd9\" id=\"u80c01fd9\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua344ea64\" id=\"ua344ea64\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">积分I :</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"udde9aa52\" id=\"udde9aa52\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u85f8a4ef\" id=\"u85f8a4ef\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">e(i) 误差</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1c4d4bac\" id=\"u1c4d4bac\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3d10455c\" id=\"u3d10455c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">微分D :</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u59a2ab69\" id=\"u59a2ab69\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> e(k) - 2e(k-1)+e(k-2) 这次误差-2*上次误差+上上次误差</span></p></blockquote><blockquote data-lake-id=\"ud8f1bc7b\" id=\"ud8f1bc7b\"><p data-lake-id=\"u4322ae3d\" id=\"u4322ae3d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u156999a4\" id=\"u156999a4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.54)\">注意:结果只是增量,需要和前面的增量进行累加才能使用</span></p></blockquote>",
